    "Hear directly from adult children finding safe homes for parents, and healthcare entrepreneurs launching successful care communities.": "Pakinggan ang mga anak na nakahanap ng ligtas na tahanan para sa magulang, at mga healthcare entrepreneur na matagumpay na nagbukas ng komunidad.",
    "\"When Mom was diagnosed with progressive dementia, hospital discharge gave us 48 hours to find a place. Love RCFE took my panic, calmed me down, and placed her in an intimate 6-bed home 10 minutes away. Mom is smiling again.\"": "\"Nang ma-diagnose si Nanay na may dementia, binigyan lang kami ng ospital ng 48 oras bago i-discharge para humanap ng matitirhan. Pinakalma ako ng Love RCFE at nailipat siya sa isang maaliwalas na 6-bed home na 10 minuto lang ang layo. Ngumingiti na ulit si Nanay.\"",
    "Daughter & Family Caregiver, San Jose CA": "Anak at Tagapag-alaga sa Pamilya, San Jose CA",
    "\"As a registered nurse, I knew patient care, but California Title 22 bureaucracy almost made me quit. Love RCFE wrote our Plan of Operation, coached our Component III interview, and we passed our pre-licensing inspection on the first visit.\"": "\"Bilang registered nurse, kabisado ko ang pag-aalaga ng pasyente, pero muntik na akong sumuko sa dami ng papel sa California Title 22. Isinulat ng Love RCFE ang aming Plan of Operation, tinuruan kami sa Component III interview, at nakapasa kami sa unang inspeksyon pa lang.\"",
    "Licensed RCFE Owner, Sacramento CA": "Lisensyadong May-ari ng RCFE, Sacramento CA",
    "\"They explained the difference between commercial 100-resident assisted living facilities and small residential board-and-care homes. That saved us nearly $2,400 a month and gave my father 1-on-3 personal attention.\"": "\"Ipinaliwanag nila ang kaibahan ng malalaking 100-residenteng assisted living at ng maliliit na residential board-and-care home. Nakatipid kami ng halos $2,400 bawat buwan at nabigyan si Tatay ng 1-sa-3 na personal na pag-aalaga.\"",
